125
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,480
We call it a mantle.

126
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:13,500
And there's a place there to hang these and the place where all of the smoke from the fire comes out is the chimney.

127
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:16,140
It's also the place where Santa Claus comes down.

128
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,560
Right.

129
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:29,000
